DESCRIPTION:Naked Dawn is a Latin duo with a genre-bending PanAmericana sound that spans styles from rock\, blues\, and folk\, to traditional Mexican song forms.  With influences ranging from the verdant hills of Evergreen\, Colorado\, to the sun-soaked campo de Oaxaca\, Mexico\, Britton Barrett on percussion teams up with H. Howells on vocals and guitar\, to bring an eclectic mix of songs in Spanish and English.  You’ll find messages of healing\, inclusion\, equanimity\, romance\, vitality\, justice\, and radical love in every breath of their wide-ranging songs.\nConnect with Naked Dawn\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/live-music-at-st-vrain-cidery-naked-dawn
DTEND:20260411T023000Z
